utan u tablici pretraživanja','The provided checkout link was out of date or invalid. No products were added to the cart.'=>'Navedena poveznica za naplatu bila je zastarjela ili nevažeća. U košaricu nije dodan nijedan proizvod.','The provided email address (%s) is not valid—please provide a valid email address'=>'Navedena adresa e-pošte (%s) nije važeća—navedite valjanu adresu e-pošte','The provided email address is not valid'=>'Navedena adresa e-pošte nije važeća','The provided handler %1$s does not implement %2$s.'=>'Pruženi rukovatelj (handler) %1$s ne implementira %2$s.','The provided phone number is not valid'=>'Navedeni broj telefona nije valjan','The provided postcode / ZIP is not valid'=>'Navedeni poštanski broj nije valjan','The provided state (%1$s) is not valid. Must be one of: %2$s'=>'Navedeno stanje (%1$s) nije važeće. Mora biti jedan od: %2$s','The provider ID must be a string with only ASCII letters, digits, underscores, and dashes.'=>'ID pružatelja usluga mora biti niz koji sadrži samo ASCII slova, znamenke, podvlake i crtice.','The quantity of &quot;%1$s&quot; cannot be changed'=>'Količina &quot;%1$s&quot; ne može se mijenjati','The quantity of &quot;%1$s&quot; must be a multiple of %2$s'=>'Količina &quot;%1$s&quot; mora biti višekratnik %2$s','The rate at which tax is applied.'=>'Stopa po kojoj se primjenjuje porez.','The relative path of the step to use for frontend navigation.'=>'Relativna putanja koraka koja se koristi za navigaciju na frontendu.','The requested plugin `%s` could not be activated.'=>'Traženi dodatak `%s` nije mogao biti aktiviran.','The requested plugin `%s` could not be installed.'=>'Traženi dodatak `%s` nije mogao biti instaliran.','The requested plugin `%s` could not be installed. Plugin API call failed.'=>'Traženi plugin `%s` nije mogao biti instaliran. Poziv API-ja plugina nije uspio.','The requested plugin `%s` could not be installed. Upgrader install failed.'=>'Traženi dodatak `%s` nije moguće instalirati. Instalacija ažuriranja nije uspjela.','The requested plugin `%s`. is not yet installed.'=>'Traženi dodatak `%s` još nije instaliran.','The requested theme `%s` could not be installed.'=>'Tražena tema `%s` nije se mogla instalirati.','The requested theme `%s` could not be installed. Theme API call failed.'=>'Tražena tema `%s` nije se mogla instalirati. Poziv API-ja teme nije uspio.','The requested theme could not be activated.'=>'Tražena tema nije se mogla aktivirati.','The resource cannot be deleted.'=>'Resurs ne može biti izbrisan.','The response body from the receiving server.'=>'The response body from the receiving server.','The Retro Glass Jug\'s classic silhouette effortlessly complements any setting, making it the ideal choice for serving beverages with style and flair.'=>'Klasična silueta retro staklenog vrča bez napora nadopunjuje svako okruženje, što ga čini idealnim izborom za posluživanje pića sa stilom i štihom.','The root URL of your site.'=>'Korjenski URL vaše web-stranice.','The sale will start at 00:00:00 of "From" date and end at 23:59:59 of "To" date.'=>'Rasprodaja počinje u 00:00:00 od datuma "Od" i završava u 23:59:59 od datuma "Do".','The search feature in WooCommerce is easy to use.'=>'Značajka pretraživanja jednostavna je za korištenje.','The search\'s functionality meets my needs.'=>'Funkcionalnosti pretrage zadovoljavaju moje potrebe.','The secret key is used to generate a hash of the delivered webhook and provided in the request headers.'=>'The Secret Key is used to generate a hash of the delivered webhook and provided in the request headers.','The selected product is invalid.'=>'Odabrani proizvod nije važeći.','The selected product isn\'t a variation of %2$s, please choose product options by visiting <a href="%1$s" title="%2$s">%2$s</a>.'=>'Odabrani proizvod nije varijacija %2$s, odaberite opcije proizvoda tako da posjetite <a href="%1$s" title="%2$s">%2$s</a>.','The settings of this image size have been disabled because its values are being overwritten 