ve'=>'Ne odobri','Unapprove this review'=>'Odbaci ovu recenziju','Uncropped'=>'Neizrezano','Understanding the status report'=>'Razumijevanje Izvještaja o statusu','Undo'=>'Poništi','Undo?'=>'Poništi?','unexpected shutdown: PHP Fatal error %1$s in %2$s on line %3$s'=>'neočekivan prestanak: PHP greška %1$s  u %2$s na liniji %3$s','Unfortunately <strong>we do not ship %s</strong>. Please enter an alternative shipping address.'=>'Nažalost, <strong>ne šaljemo u %s</strong>. Molimo unesite drugu adresu za dostavu.','Unfortunately your order cannot be processed as the originating bank/merchant has declined your transaction. Please attempt your purchase again.'=>'Na žalost, vaša narudžba ne može biti obrađena jer je banka/prodavatelj odbila vašu transakciju. Molimo, pokušajte ponoviti kupnju.','Unfortunately, the payment for order #%1$s from %2$s has failed. The order was as follows:'=>'Nažalost, plaćanje za narudžbu broj %1$s od %2$s nije uspjelo. Narudžba je bila sljedeća:','Unfortunately, we couldn\'t complete your order due to an issue with your payment method.'=>'Nažalost, nismo uspjeli dovršiti vašu narudžbu zbog problema s vašim načinom plaćanja.','Ungheni'=>'Ungheni','Unidentified action %s: we were unable to cancel this action. It may may have been deleted by another process.'=>'Neidentificirana radnja %s: nismo uspjeli otkazati ovu radnju. Možda je izbrisan drugim postupkom.','Unidentified action %s: we were unable to delete this action. It may may have been deleted by another process.'=>'Neidentificirana radnja %s: nismo uspjeli izbrisati ovu radnju. Možda je izbrisan drugim postupkom.','Unidentified action %s: we were unable to determine the date of this action. It may may have been deleted by another process.'=>'Neidentificirana radnja %s: nismo uspjeli odrediti datum ove akcije. Možda je izbrisan drugim postupkom.','Unidentified action %s: we were unable to mark this action as having completed. It may may have been deleted by another process.'=>'Neidentificira