t Elements'=>'Elementi proizvoda WooCommerce','WooCommerce products (CSV)'=>'WooCommerce proizvodi (CSV)','WooCommerce Recent Reviews'=>'Najnovije WooCommerce recenzije','WooCommerce Services'=>'WooCommerce Services','WooCommerce Services icon'=>'WooCommerce Services ikona','WooCommerce Settings'=>'WooCommerce postavke','WooCommerce settings'=>'WooCommerce Postavke','WooCommerce Setup'=>'WooCommerce postavljanje','WooCommerce Shipping'=>'WooCommerce Shipping','WooCommerce Square'=>'WooCommerce Square','WooCommerce Status'=>'WooCommerce status','WooCommerce status'=>'WooCommerce status','WooCommerce Store Identifier.'=>'Identifikator trgovine WooCommerce.','WooCommerce Stripe Gateway'=>'WooCommerce Stripe Gateway','WooCommerce Subscriptions allows you to introduce a variety of subscriptions for physical or virtual products and services. Create product-of-the-month clubs, weekly service subscriptions or even yearly software billing packages. Add sign-up fees, offer free trials, or set expiration periods.'=>'WooCommerce Subscriptions omogućuju vam da ponudite brojne pretplate za fizičke ili virtualne proizvode i usluge. Kreirajte proizvod-mjeseca klubove, pretplate za tjedne usluge ili čak pakete za godišnju naplatu softvera. Dodajte naknadu za upis, ponudite besplatne periode, ili postavite ograničene vremenske periode.','WooCommerce support'=>'WooCommerce podrška','WooCommerce Tax'=>'WooCommerce Tax','WooCommerce tax rates (CSV)'=>'WooCommerce porezne stope (CSV)','WooCommerce transients'=>'WooCommerce prijelazi (transients)','WooCommerce version'=>'WooCommerce inačica','WooCommerce version.'=>'WooCommerce inačica.','WooCommerce webhooks that use the Legacy REST API are unsupported'=>'WooCommerce web-dojavnici koji koriste naslijeđeni REST API nisu podržani','WooCommerce.com'=>'WooCommerce.com','WooCommerce.com API returned an invalid response.'=>'WooCommerce.com API je vratio nevažeći odgovor.','WooCommerce.com API returned HTTP status code %d.'=>'WooCommerce.com AP