d and activated <a href="%1$s">the Legacy REST API plugin</a> because this site has <a href="%2$s">the Legacy REST API enabled</a> or has <a href="%3$s">legacy webhooks defined</a>. <a href="%4$s">More information</a>'=>'i️ WooCommerce je instalirao i <a href="%1$s">aktivirao dodatak Legacy REST API</a> jer ova stranica ima <a href="%2$s">omogućen Legacy REST API</a> ili ima <a href="%3$s">definirane naslijeđene webhookove</a>. <a href="%4$s">Više informacija</a>','ℹ️️ The WooCommerce Legacy REST API extension is installed and active.'=>'ℹ️️ WooCommerce Legacy REST API proširenje je instalirano i aktivno.','⚠ 1 Incompatible plugin detected (%s).'=>'⚠ 1 Otkriven je nekompatibilan dodatak (%s).','⚠ 2 Incompatible plugins detected (%1$s and %2$s).'=>'⚠ 2 Otkriveni su nekompatibilni dodaci (%1$s i %2$s).','⚠ <b><a target="_blank" href="%s">The Legacy REST API plugin</a> is installed and active on this site.</b> Please be aware that the WooCommerce Legacy REST API is <b>not</b> compatible with HPOS.'=>'⚠ <b><a target="_blank" href="%s">Stari REST API dodatak</a> instaliran je i aktivan na ovoj stranici.</b> Imajte na umu da je WooCommerce stari REST API <b>nije</b> kompatibilno s HPOS-om.','⚠ <b><a target="_blank" href="%s">The Legacy REST API</a> is active on this site.</b> Please be aware that the WooCommerce Legacy REST API is <b>not</b> compatible with HPOS.'=>'⚠ <b><a target="_blank" href="%s">Stari REST API</a> aktivan je na ovoj stranici.</b> Imajte na umu da WooCommerce stari REST API <b>nije </b> kompatibilan s HPOS-om.','⚠ Incompatible plugins detected (%1$s, %2$s and %3$d other).'=>'⚠ Otkriveni su nekompatibilni dodaci (%1$s, %2$s i %3$d drugi).' . "\0" . '' . "\0" . '','⚠ This plugin is incompatible with the enabled WooCommerce feature \'%s\', it shouldn\'t be activated.'=>'⚠ Ovaj dodatak nije kompatibilan s omogućenom WooCommerce značajkom \'%s\', ne bi ga trebali aktivirati.','⚠ This plugin is incompatible with the enabled WooCommerce features \'%1$s\' and \'%2$s\', it shouldn\'t be activated.'=>'⚠ Ovaj dodatak nije kompatibilan s omogućenim WooCommerce značajkama \'%1$s\' i \'%2$s\', ne bi ga trebali aktivirati.','⚠ This plugin is incompatible with the enabled WooCommerce features \'%1$s\', \'%2$s\' and %3$d more, it shouldn\'t be activated.'=>'⚠ Ovaj dodatak nije kompatibilan s omogućenim značajkama WooCommercea \'%1$s\', \'%2$s\' i %3$d, ne bi ga trebali aktivirati.','⚠ Usage tracking must be enabled to use remote logging.'=>'⚠ Praćenje korištenja mora biti omogućeno za korištenje udaljenog evidentiranja.','⚠️ Only %s files can be searched at one time. Try filtering the file list before searching.'=>'⚠️ Istovremeno se mogu pretraživati samo %s datoteke. Pokušajte filtrirati popis datoteka prije pretraživanja.','⚠️ The file system connection could not be initialized.'=>'⚠️ Veza s datotečnim sustavom nije se mogla pokrenuti.','⚠️ The file system is not configured for direct writes. This could cause problems for the logger.'=>'⚠️ Sustav datoteka nije konfiguriran za izravno pisanje. To bi moglo uzrokovati probleme zapisivaču.','⚠️ The WooCommerce Legacy REST API has been moved to <a target=”_blank” href="%1$s">a dedicated extension</a>. <b><a target=”_blank” href="%2$s">Learn more about this change</a></b>'=>'⚠️ WooCommerce Legacy REST API premješten je u <a target=”_blank” href="%1$s">namjensko proširenje</a>. <b><a target=”_blank” href="%2$s">Saznajte više o ovoj promjeni</a></b>','⚠️ The WooCommerce Legacy REST API has been removed from WooCommerce, this will cause <a href="%1$s">webhooks on this site that are configured to use the Legacy REST API</a> to stop working. <a target="_blank" href="%2$s">A separate WooCommerce extension is available</a> to allow these webhooks to keep using the Legacy REST API without interruption. You can also edit these webhooks to use the current REST API version to generate the payload instead. <b><a target="_blank" href="%3$s">Learn more about this change.</a></b>'=>'⚠️ WooCommerce Legacy REST API uklonjen je iz WooCommercea, što će uzrokovati prestanak rada <a href="%1$s">webhookova na ovoj web stranici koji su konfigurirani za korištenje naslijeđenog REST API-ja</a> . <a target="_blank" href="%2$s">Dostupno je zasebno proširenje WooCommerce</a> koje omogućuje tim webhookovima da nastave koristiti naslijeđeni REST API bez prekida. Te web-dojavnike možete urediti i tako da biste umjesto toga koristili trenutnu verziju REST API-ja za generiranje korisnog tereta. <b><a target="_blank" href="%3$s">Saznajte više o toj promjeni.</a></b>','⚠️ This directory does not appear to be writable.'=>'⚠️ Čini se da se ovaj direktorij ne može zapisivati.','⚠️ WooCommerce attempted to install <a href="%1$s">the Legacy REST API plugin</a> because this site has <a href="%2$s">the Legacy REST API enabled</a> or has <a href="%3$s">legacy webhooks defined</a>, but the installation failed (see error details in <a href="%4$s">the WooCommerce logs</a>). Please install and activate the plugin manually. <a href="%5$s">More information</a>'=>'⚠️ WooCommerce je pokušao instalirati <a href="%1$s">dodatak Legacy REST API</a> jer je na ovoj stranici <a href="%2$s">omogućen Legacy REST API</a> ili su <a href="%3$s">definirani naslijeđeni webhookovi</a>, ali instalacija nije uspjela (pogledajte pojedinosti o pogrešci u <a href="%4$s">zapisnicima WooCommercea</a>). Instalirajte i aktivirajte dodatak ručno. <a href="%5$s">Više informacija</a>','⚠️ WooCommerce installed <a href="%1$s">the Legacy REST API plugin</a> because this site has <a href="%2$s">the Legacy REST API enabled</a> or has <a href="%3$s">legacy webhooks defined</a>, but it failed to activate it (see error details in <a href="%4$s">the WooCommerce logs</a>). Please go to <a href="%5$s">the plugins page</a> and activate it manually. <a href="%6$s">More information</a>'=>'⚠️ WooCommerce je <a href="%1$s">instalirao dodatak Legacy REST API</a> jer ova stranica ima <a href="%2$s">omogućen Legacy REST API</a> ili ima <a href="%3$s">definirane naslijeđene webhookove</a>, ali ga nije uspjela aktivirati (pogledajte pojedinosti o pogrešci u <a href="%4$s">zapisnicima WooCommercea</a>). Idite na <a href="%5$s">stranicu dodataka</a> i aktivirajte je ručno. <a href="%6$s">Više informacija</a>','✅ Ready'=>'✅ Spremno','🎉 Congrats on adding your first product!'=>'🎉 Čestitke na dodavanju vašeg prvog proizvoda!']];
